  "details": "Open Beta 2023.3.3 (build 1348) `A Change to the \"Go\" Button!` https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/503009489486872583/1154195262319906818\n\nStrings on the Crowdin only reflect this change partially. Some strings still need to be added.\n\nThat option is on `MM > Settings > User Interface > General UI Settings`\n\n# Old\n\n- Label: 23227 `Skip Go Button On Load`\n\n- Tooltip: 13345 `Automatically enter the world when it's ready`\n\n- Alert (to be on): 24911 `Skip Go Button enabled`\n\n- Alert (to be off): 24909 `Skip Go Button disabled` \n\n#  New\n\n- Label: (**not added yet**) `Show Go Button On Load`\n\n- Tooltip: 26627 `Show a \"Go!\" button before entering the world when it's ready`\n\n- Alert (to be on): (**not added yet**) `Show Go Button enabled`\n\n- Alert (to be off): (**not added yet**) `Show Go Button disabled`\n\n# Note\n\nThis change also invalidates some VRCat messages.\n\nSee https://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1154383799665303554",
